#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, lockInPlace)
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:271
msgid ""
"Check this option if you do not want the icons to be moveable in the view.\n"
"\n"
"This option is useful if you want to avoid accidentally moving the icons "
"while interacting with them."
msgstr ""
"Escolla esta opción se non quer que se podan mover as iconas pola vista.\n"
"\n"
"Esta opción é útil se quer evitar mover accidentalmente as iconas mentres "
"está a interactuar con eles."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, alignToGridLabel)
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:281
msgid "Align to grid:"
msgstr "Aliñar en grella:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, alignToGrid)
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:293
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want the icons to be arranged in a grid.\n"
"\n"
"When this option is checked, icons will automatically snap to the nearest "
"grid cell when you move them around in the view."
msgstr ""
"Escolla esta opción para dispor as iconas nunha grella.\n"
"\n"
"Se sinala esta opción, as iconas axustaranse automaticamente á cela máis "
"próxima cando as mova pola vista."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, clickToViewLabel)
#: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:303
